{"content":"<!-- wp:e3es\/intro-banner {\"title\":\"Water \\u0026amp; Wastewater Infrastructure Solutions\",\"bgImageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg\",\"subtitle\":\"Turnkey water and wastewater infrastructure upgrades for Texas municipalities and public entities. Innovative, budget-neutral treatment solutions.\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-intro-banner db-page-hero\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(33, 87, 52,0.85), rgba(33, 87, 52,0.85)), url(http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg);background-size:cover;background-position:50% 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat\"><div class=\"db-page-hero__container\"><div><h1 class=\"db-page-hero__title\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase;text-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\">Water &amp; Wastewater Infrastructure Solutions<\/h1><div class=\"db-page-hero__intro\"><p>Turnkey water and wastewater infrastructure upgrades for Texas municipalities and public entities. Innovative, budget-neutral treatment solutions.<\/p><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/intro-banner -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sustainable, Budget-Neutral Infrastructure Modernization<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Managing municipal water networks and wastewater treatment plants is a major financial and regulatory challenge for Texas cities and public entities. Aging pipe networks suffer from mineral scale buildup that constricts water flow and harbors bacteria, wastewater lagoons accumulate thick sludge that reduces holding capacity, and inaccurate mechanical water meters lead to lost utility revenue.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Traditional civil engineering firms recommend multi-million dollar capital projects\u2014such as mechanical dredging, chemical line flushing, or massive plant expansions\u2014that require raising taxes or utility rates.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E3 delivers a smarter, budget-neutral approach through our <strong>Design-Build<\/strong> model. We introduce innovative, eco-friendly, and pre-approved technologies that resolve your infrastructure bottlenecks, guarantee regulatory compliance, and pay for themselves through operational savings and increased utility revenue.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The E3 Water &amp; Wastewater Value Propositions<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"is-style-default\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list is-style-default\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Alternative to Dredging:<\/strong> Our nanobubble technology digests wastewater sludge naturally in-place, eliminating the high cost of dredging, dewatering, and landfill hauling.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Eco-Friendly Pipe Descaling:<\/strong> Our Bicarbus treatment descales pipe networks and eliminates biofilms safely, reducing chlorine chemical demands.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Revenue Recovery:<\/strong> Modern AMR\/AMI metering packages accurately capture low flows, recovering lost utility revenue to offset project costs.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>TCEQ Compliance Guarantee:<\/strong> We design every project to meet Texas Commission on Environmental Quality (TCEQ) standards, resolving outstanding compliance mandates.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our Turnkey Water &amp; Wastewater Offerings<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"listLabel\":\"Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling \\u0026amp; Disinfection)\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/cooke-county.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling u0026 Disinfection)\",\"icon\":\"layers\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling u0026 Disinfection)\",\"overlayText\":\"Clean municipal water mains and remove biofilms with budget-neutral Bicarbus descaling.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"See Water Treatment Descaling u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/municipal-water-treatment\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--white\"><div class=\"db-feature__container\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling &amp; Disinfection)<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Descale aging water mains and eliminate biofilms. Our Bicarbus chemical descaling technology naturally removes calcium carbonate scale and microbial growth, improving water pressure and reducing carcinogens (TTHMs) by lowering chlorine demands.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/cooke-county.jpg\" alt=\"Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling u0026 Disinfection)\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">Municipal Water Treatment (Bicarbus Descaling u0026 Disinfection)<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Clean municipal water mains and remove biofilms with budget-neutral Bicarbus descaling.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/municipal-water-treatment\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">See Water Treatment Descaling u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"bgStyle\":\"grey\",\"reverse\":true,\"listLabel\":\"Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)\",\"icon\":\"star\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)\",\"overlayText\":\"Eliminate lagoon sludge organically without the disruption of physical dredging.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"View Lagoon Sludge Remediation u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/wastewater-sludge-remediation\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--grey\"><div class=\"db-feature__container db-feature__container--reverse\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Restore lagoon holding capacity without dredging. We install nanobubble generators that infuse millions of microscopic oxygen bubbles into wastewater lagoons, feeding aerobic bacteria that naturally digest organic sludge.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg\" alt=\"Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">Wastewater Sludge Remediation (Nanobubble Technology)<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Eliminate lagoon sludge organically without the disruption of physical dredging.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/wastewater-sludge-remediation\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">View Lagoon Sludge Remediation u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"listLabel\":\"Water Meter Installation \\u0026amp; Lift Station Rehabilitation\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/donna-isd.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Water Meter Installation u0026 Lift Station Rehabilitation\",\"icon\":\"shield\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"Water Meter Installation u0026 Lift Station Rehabilitation\",\"overlayText\":\"Upgrade mechanical water meters to AMI systems to recover lost billing revenue.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"See AMI Metering Upgrades u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-meter-installation\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--white\"><div class=\"db-feature__container\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Water Meter Installation &amp; Lift Station Rehabilitation<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recover lost utility revenue and secure lift station reliability. We install smart water meters (AMR\/AMI) and replace worn-out lift station pumps, check valves, and controls to ensure smooth wastewater transfer.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/donna-isd.jpg\" alt=\"Water Meter Installation u0026 Lift Station Rehabilitation\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">Water Meter Installation u0026 Lift Station Rehabilitation<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Upgrade mechanical water meters to AMI systems to recover lost billing revenue.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-meter-installation\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">See AMI Metering Upgrades u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"bgStyle\":\"grey\",\"reverse\":true,\"listLabel\":\"Water Conservation \\u0026amp; Low-Flow Upgrades\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/bryan-isd.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Water Conservation u0026 Low-Flow Upgrades\",\"icon\":\"layers\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"Water Conservation u0026 Low-Flow Upgrades\",\"overlayText\":\"Reduce building water consumption by up to 40% with smart plumbing retrofits.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"View Water Conservation Projects u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-conservation\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--grey\"><div class=\"db-feature__container db-feature__container--reverse\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Water Conservation &amp; Low-Flow Upgrades<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reduce water consumption by up to 40%. We upgrade building fixtures with low-flow flushometers, faucet aerators, and install smart irrigation controllers with integrated leak-detection monitoring.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/bryan-isd.jpg\" alt=\"Water Conservation u0026 Low-Flow Upgrades\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">Water Conservation u0026 Low-Flow Upgrades<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Reduce building water consumption by up to 40% with smart plumbing retrofits.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-conservation\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">View Water Conservation Projects u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"listLabel\":\"Water Wells \\u0026amp; Pump Systems\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/cooke-county.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Water Wells u0026 Pump Systems\",\"icon\":\"star\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"Water Wells u0026 Pump Systems\",\"overlayText\":\"Restore drawdown yields and serviceability of municipal water well infrastructure.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"See Well Rehabilitation Projects u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-wells\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--white\"><div class=\"db-feature__container\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Water Wells &amp; Pump Systems<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Secure your primary water sources. We perform water well testing, replace submersible and vertical turbine pumps, and rehabilitate well screens to restore original gallon-per-minute (GPM) yields.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/cooke-county.jpg\" alt=\"Water Wells u0026 Pump Systems\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">Water Wells u0026 Pump Systems<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Restore drawdown yields and serviceability of municipal water well infrastructure.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/water-wells\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">See Well Rehabilitation Projects u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/two-column {\"bgStyle\":\"grey\",\"reverse\":true,\"listLabel\":\"SCADA Telemetry \\u0026amp; TCEQ Compliance\",\"imageUrl\":\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"SCADA Telemetry u0026 TCEQ Compliance\",\"icon\":\"shield\",\"overlayHeadline\":\"SCADA Telemetry u0026 TCEQ Compliance\",\"overlayText\":\"Gain real-time visibility into tank levels, pressure, and chemical residuals.\",\"overlayBtnText\":\"View SCADA u0026 Telemetry Upgrades u0026rarr;\",\"overlayBtnUrl\":\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/scada\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-two-column db-feature db-feature--grey\"><div class=\"db-feature__container db-feature__container--reverse\"><div class=\"db-feature__content\"><div class=\"db-feature__icon\"><\/div><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SCADA Telemetry &amp; TCEQ Compliance<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Centralize system visibility. We install SCADA telemetry systems to monitor tank levels, water pressure, and chlorine residuals remotely, ensuring automatic alerts and continuous compliance with TCEQ standards.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><div class=\"db-feature__image-wrapper\"><img src=\"http:\/\/e3es2026.local\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/ricardo-isd.jpg\" alt=\"SCADA Telemetry u0026 TCEQ Compliance\" class=\"db-feature__image\"\/><div class=\"db-feature__image-overlay\"><div class=\"db-feature__overlay-content\"><h3 class=\"db-feature__overlay-headline\">SCADA Telemetry u0026 TCEQ Compliance<\/h3><p class=\"db-feature__overlay-text\">Gain real-time visibility into tank levels, pressure, and chemical residuals.<\/p><a href=\"\/services\/water-wastewater\/scada\" class=\"btn btn--outline-white db-feature__overlay-button\">View SCADA u0026 Telemetry Upgrades u0026rarr;<\/a><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/two-column -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Traditional Engineering vs. E3 Infrastructure Solutions<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Texas Project Success<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>E3 has implemented water and wastewater upgrades for municipalities and school districts across Texas:<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>South Texas Municipalities:<\/strong> Deployed Bicarbus water descaling networks in aging public water grids, significantly lowering chlorine demands and reducing TTHM chemical levels.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Central Texas Wastewater Plants:<\/strong> Installed nanobubble aeration systems in municipal wastewater lagoons, reducing sludge depths and avoiding dredging costs.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>K-12 School Districts:<\/strong> Implemented low-flow plumbing retrofits and smart irrigation systems, helping districts conserve municipal water resources.<\/li>\n<!-- \/wp:list-item --><\/ul>\n<!-- \/wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/cta-banner {\"title\":\"Ready to Optimize Your Facility?\",\"text\":\"Contact our Texas energy experts to schedule a free Preliminary Energy Study. Learn how you can fund modern upgrades using guaranteed utility savings.\",\"btnText\":\"Request a Free Assessment\",\"btnUrl\":\"\/contact\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-cta-banner cta-banner\"><div class=\"cta-banner__container\"><h2 class=\"cta-banner__title\">Ready to Optimize Your Facility?<\/h2><p class=\"cta-banner__text\">Contact our Texas energy experts to schedule a free Preliminary Energy Study. Learn how you can fund modern upgrades using guaranteed utility savings.<\/p><a href=\"\/contact\" class=\"btn btn--primary cta-banner__btn\">Request a Free Assessment<\/a><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/cta-banner -->\n\n<!-- wp:e3es\/faq-section -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-e3es-faq-section faq-section\"><div class=\"faq-section__container\"><h2 class=\"faq-section__title\">Frequently Asked Questions<\/h2><div class=\"faq-section__desc-wrapper\"><svg xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"var(--color-primary-green, #7DA044)\" style=\"flex-shrink:0\"><path d=\"M256 512A256 256 0 1 0 256 0a256 256 0 1 0 0 512zM169.8 165.3c7.9-22.3 29.1-37.3 52.8-37.3h58.3c34.9 0 63.1 28.3 63.1 63.1 0 22.6-12.1 43.5-31.7 54.8L280 264.4c-.2 13-10.9 23.6-24 23.6c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24v-13.5c0-8.6 4.6-16.5 12.1-20.8l44.3-25.4c4.7-2.7 7.6-7.7 7.6-13.1 0-8.4-6.8-15.1-15.1-15.1H222.6c-3.4 0-6.4 2.1-7.5 5.3l-.4 1.2c-4.4 12.5-18.2 19-30.6 14.6s-19-18.2-14.6-30.6l.4-1.2zM224 352a32 32 0 1 1 64 0 32 32 0 1 1 -64 0z\"><\/path><\/svg><p class=\"faq-section__desc\">Commonly asked questions about our process, services, and results.<\/p><\/div><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Does biological sludge digestion using nanobubbles replace physical dredging for wastewater lagoons?<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How does Bicarbus chemical descaling work, and does it help lower municipal TTHM levels?<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How do AMI smart water meters recover lost utility billing revenue for Texas municipalities?<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div><\/section>\n<!-- \/wp:e3es\/faq-section -->"}